<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>VS Code on 刘贵泷的个人网页</title><link>https://Guilong-gitlab.github.io/tags/vs-code/</link><description>Recent content in VS Code on 刘贵泷的个人网页</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>Guilong Liu</copyright><lastBuildDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://Guilong-gitlab.github.io/tags/vs-code/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>VS Code 配置 XeLaTeX 与 Biber</title><link>https://Guilong-gitlab.github.io/p/vscode-xelatex-biber/</link><pubDate>Thu, 10 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Guilong-gitlab.github.io/p/vscode-xelatex-biber/</guid><description>&lt;p>本文使用 TeX Live、VS Code 和 LaTeX Workshop，配置 &lt;code>XeLaTeX → Biber → XeLaTeX → XeLaTeX&lt;/code> 编译流程，适合中文文档与 &lt;code>biblatex&lt;/code> 参考文献。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="1-安装与检查">1. 安装与检查
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>按 &lt;a class="link" href="https://tug.org/texlive/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>TeX Live 官方安装说明&lt;/a> 安装发行版，再在 VS Code 扩展中安装 &lt;strong>LaTeX Workshop&lt;/strong>。打开新终端检查：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>xelatex --version
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>biber --version
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>两条命令都应能找到程序。安装后仍提示命令不存在时，检查 TeX Live 的可执行文件目录是否在 PATH 中，并重启 VS Code。发行版已安装但缺少宏包时，应通过该发行版的包管理方式补齐。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="2-配置编译步骤">2. 配置编译步骤
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>打开项目文件夹，通过命令面板选择 &lt;code>Preferences: Open Workspace Settings (JSON)&lt;/code>，在 &lt;code>.vscode/settings.json&lt;/code> 中合并以下配置。若原文件已有内容，只添加字段，不要再套一层大括号。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">12
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">13
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">14
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">15
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">16
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">17
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">18
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">19
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">20
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">21
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>{
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;latex-workshop.latex.tools&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: [
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> {
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;xelatex&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;command&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;xelatex&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;args&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: [&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;-synctex=1&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;-interaction=nonstopmode&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;-file-line-error&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;%DOC%&amp;#34;&lt;/span>]
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> },
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> {
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;biber&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;command&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;biber&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;args&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: [&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;%DOCFILE%&amp;#34;&lt;/span>]
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> }
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> ],
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;latex-workshop.latex.recipes&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: [
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> {
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;XeLaTeX → Biber → XeLaTeX × 2&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;tools&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: [&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;xelatex&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;biber&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;xelatex&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;xelatex&amp;#34;&lt;/span>]
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> }
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> ],
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;latex-workshop.latex.autoBuild.run&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;never&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>先手动构建，确认流程正常后再考虑自动构建。这套配置让输出与根 &lt;code>.tex&lt;/code> 文件位于同一目录；若改用其他输出目录，需要同步修改 XeLaTeX 和 Biber 的参数。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="3-创建最小测试工程">3. 创建最小测试工程
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>在同一个文件夹中建立 &lt;code>main.tex&lt;/code> 与 &lt;code>ref.bib&lt;/code>。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;code>main.tex&lt;/code>：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">12
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">13
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">14
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-tex" data-lang="tex">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">\documentclass&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">[UTF8]&lt;/span>{ctexart}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">\usepackage&lt;/span>{amsmath}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">\usepackage&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">[backend=biber,style=numeric]&lt;/span>{biblatex}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">\addbibresource&lt;/span>{ref.bib}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">\title&lt;/span>{XeLaTeX 编译测试}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">\author&lt;/span>{测试作者}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">\date&lt;/span>{&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">\today&lt;/span>}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">\begin&lt;/span>{document}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">\maketitle&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>中文正文与公式：&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">\(&lt;/span>E&lt;span style="color:#f92672">=&lt;/span>mc^&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">2&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">\)&lt;/span>。
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>参考文献引用示例：&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">\cite&lt;/span>{khasminskii2011stochastic}。
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">\printbibliography&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">\end&lt;/span>{document}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;code>ref.bib&lt;/code>：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">6
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bibtex" data-lang="bibtex">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">@book&lt;/span>{khasminskii2011stochastic,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">title&lt;/span> = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">{Stochastic Stability of Differential Equations}&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">author&lt;/span> = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">{Khasminskii, Rafail}&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">year&lt;/span> = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">{2011}&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e">publisher&lt;/span> = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">{Springer}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="4-编译与验证">4. 编译与验证
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>打开 &lt;code>main.tex&lt;/code>，在命令面板运行 &lt;strong>LaTeX Workshop: Build with recipe&lt;/strong>，选择上面定义的配方。也可以在文件所在目录依次执行：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">4
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>xelatex main.tex
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>biber main
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>xelatex main.tex
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>xelatex main.tex
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>第一次 XeLaTeX 生成 Biber 需要的控制文件，Biber 读取 &lt;code>.bib&lt;/code> 生成参考文献，后两次 XeLaTeX 更新引用与交叉引用。检查 &lt;code>main.pdf&lt;/code> 中是否显示中文、文献编号和文末参考文献列表。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>多文件论文应从根文件构建；子文件可以添加 &lt;code>% !TEX root = main.tex&lt;/code>，路径按实际目录调整。模板如果使用 BibTeX 而不是 &lt;code>biblatex&lt;/code>，应遵循模板流程，不能直接套用 Biber。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="5-清理辅助文件">5. 清理辅助文件
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>在命令面板运行 &lt;strong>LaTeX Workshop: Clean up auxiliary files&lt;/strong>。如需快捷键，可在 &lt;code>Preferences: Open Keyboard Shortcuts (JSON)&lt;/code> 中添加：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">6
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">7
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>[
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> {
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;key&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;ctrl+shift+delete&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;command&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;latex-workshop.clean&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;when&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;editorLangId == latex&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> }
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>]
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>该方式通过扩展清理辅助文件，不依赖当前终端是 PowerShell、Bash 还是 CMD。清理规则可以在扩展设置中调整。若需要 PDF 与源码双向跳转，保留 &lt;code>.synctex.gz&lt;/code>；清理后也可以重新编译生成。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="6-常见错误">6. 常见错误
&lt;/h2>&lt;table>
&lt;thead>
&lt;tr>
&lt;th>现象&lt;/th>
&lt;th>检查与处理&lt;/th>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;/thead>
&lt;tbody>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>找不到 &lt;code>xelatex&lt;/code> 或 &lt;code>biber&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
&lt;td>检查 TeX Live 安装、PATH 和 VS Code 进程环境&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>找不到 &lt;code>ref.bib&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
&lt;td>检查文件名、路径和根文件位置&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>引用显示为问号&lt;/td>
&lt;td>看 Biber 日志、引用键与编译顺序&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>Biber 找不到 &lt;code>.bcf&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
&lt;td>确认第一次 XeLaTeX 成功，且使用了 &lt;code>biblatex&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>中文或字体报错&lt;/td>
&lt;td>检查 &lt;code>ctex&lt;/code> 宏包和模板要求的字体&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>子文件单独编译失败&lt;/td>
&lt;td>为扩展指定正确的根文件&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;/tbody>
&lt;/table>
&lt;p>编译设置及占位符含义可查阅 &lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/James-Yu/LaTeX-Workshop/wiki/Compile" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>LaTeX Workshop 编译文档&lt;/a>。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>